<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A useful macro of auto-attacks for the melee Dualsword Phantom Slayer and works for all modes.It will automatically do the stabs (A MODE) for you.

Line17 to line28 are for the Zombie Scenario mode.Please remember to edit your Bookmark Z to Phantom Slayer and Bookmark C to any other melees in game.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 32 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 13 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 13 1
Delay 0 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 650 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 5 1
Delay 40 ms
KeyUp 5 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 29 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 29 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Counter-Strike Nexon: Zombies</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>